OL,3,GNEWSAFestival headlined by Andrea
OL,4,ABocelli scraps choirs fee after
OL,5,Abacklash
OL,6,
OL,7,FOrganisers of the Land of Song Festival
OL,8,Fhave announced they are scrapping a
OL,9,Fcontroversial #42 charge per choir
OL,10,Fmember.
OL,12,FThe "cheeky" fee prompted some choirs
OL,13,Fto pull out of the event after
OL,14,Frealising they would be charged
OL,15,Fthousands of pounds to take part.
OL,17,FIn a social media post, it was
OL,18,Fconfirmed the fee had been scrapped,
OL,19,Fand those entering were only required
OL,20,Fto pay the flat fee of #150 per choir.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
