OL,3,GNEWSAFestival headlined by Andrea
OL,4,ABocelli scraps choirs fee after
OL,5,Abacklash
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe two-day festival is set to take
OL,8,Fplace in May 2027, with Italian tenor
OL,9,FAndrea Bocelli featuring on the
OL,10,FSaturday, marking the first time he has
OL,11,Fplayed in Wales for 22 years.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
